    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/3dbd7aca96b54bf2403cb3923e0360a4.poster.avif?t=1696816191\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/3dbd7aca96b54bf2403cb3923e0360a4.webm?t=1696816191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/3dbd7aca96b54bf2403cb3923e0360a4.mp4?t=1696816191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>Hope's Final Defense is an action roguelite where you create a skill deck to fight hordes of enemies. Choose from many game-breaking items and upgrades. Craft overpowered builds and create deadly synergies to fight endless monsters from Negativia. Can you protect humanity's last hope?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/1c87a6ca07288d28278b8174db24389e.poster.avif?t=1696816191\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/1c87a6ca07288d28278b8174db24389e.webm?t=1696816191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/1c87a6ca07288d28278b8174db24389e.mp4?t=1696816191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategize Skills for Devastating Combos</h2>Skills are like using cards, they can create incredible combos. Strategize how to arrange skills for maximum damage.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/f0c81f3e9685f4f6e562ddd597726554.poster.avif?t=1696816191\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/f0c81f3e9685f4f6e562ddd597726554.webm?t=1696816191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/f0c81f3e9685f4f6e562ddd597726554.mp4?t=1696816191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Upgrades and Craft Items</h2>Every run offers different choices of upgrades, items, and skills. Choose carefully to create different combinations and experiences every time. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/7dcdad7559b4447bdcd9c0e2f4d7a37e.poster.avif?t=1696816191\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/7dcdad7559b4447bdcd9c0e2f4d7a37e.webm?t=1696816191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/7dcdad7559b4447bdcd9c0e2f4d7a37e.mp4?t=1696816191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customizable Playstyles</h2>Build your character to different playstyles with Blessings.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/c832d855aea4878ba062d40b6d0ed5cc.poster.avif?t=1696816191\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/c832d855aea4878ba062d40b6d0ed5cc.webm?t=1696816191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/c832d855aea4878ba062d40b6d0ed5cc.mp4?t=1696816191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Each character is unique, with their own active and passive skill, with over 35 unique upgrades. Even with the same skill there could be different ways to play it.<br></li><li>Over 20 powerful items to combine. Each with effects that alter how to craft your build.<br></li><li>Many unique enemies with their own attacks.<br></li><li>You can choose different heros to play as, if you don't have fun with one, have fun with the next one!<br></li><li>After beating a difficulty, you can try the next one.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/3dbd7aca96b54bf2403cb3923e0360a4.poster.avif?t=1696816191\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/3dbd7aca96b54bf2403cb3923e0360a4.webm?t=1696816191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/3dbd7aca96b54bf2403cb3923e0360a4.mp4?t=1696816191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>Hope's Final Defense is an action roguelite where you create a skill deck to fight hordes of enemies. Choose from many game-breaking items and upgrades. Craft overpowered builds and create deadly synergies to fight endless monsters from Negativia. Can you protect humanity's last hope?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/1c87a6ca07288d28278b8174db24389e.poster.avif?t=1696816191\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/1c87a6ca07288d28278b8174db24389e.webm?t=1696816191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/1c87a6ca07288d28278b8174db24389e.mp4?t=1696816191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategize Skills for Devastating Combos</h2>Skills are like using cards, they can create incredible combos. Strategize how to arrange skills for maximum damage.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/f0c81f3e9685f4f6e562ddd597726554.poster.avif?t=1696816191\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/f0c81f3e9685f4f6e562ddd597726554.webm?t=1696816191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/f0c81f3e9685f4f6e562ddd597726554.mp4?t=1696816191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose Upgrades and Craft Items</h2>Every run offers different choices of upgrades, items, and skills. Choose carefully to create different combinations and experiences every time. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/7dcdad7559b4447bdcd9c0e2f4d7a37e.poster.avif?t=1696816191\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/7dcdad7559b4447bdcd9c0e2f4d7a37e.webm?t=1696816191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/7dcdad7559b4447bdcd9c0e2f4d7a37e.mp4?t=1696816191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customizable Playstyles</h2>Build your character to different playstyles with Blessings.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/c832d855aea4878ba062d40b6d0ed5cc.poster.avif?t=1696816191\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/c832d855aea4878ba062d40b6d0ed5cc.webm?t=1696816191\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2379590/extras/c832d855aea4878ba062d40b6d0ed5cc.mp4?t=1696816191\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Each character is unique, with their own active and passive skill, with over 35 unique upgrades. Even with the same skill there could be different ways to play it.<br></li><li>Over 20 powerful items to combine. Each with effects that alter how to craft your build.<br></li><li>Many unique enemies with their own attacks.<br></li><li>You can choose different heros to play as, if you don't have fun with one, have fun with the next one!<br></li><li>After beating a difficulty, you can try the next one.</li></ul>",
